its land audit found [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]between the shipped Bob Refs panel and [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]plan:202610/bob_refs_panel.md: typed queries reach the model, an [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]open error re-shows the panel with its state and working buttons, [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]unavailable rows stay in place dimmed, refresh fires on wake and [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]every open, ranking follows the spec tables in local days, the [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]inspector tells the truth, the ⌘K menu anchors at the row, and [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]bob-cli drops stray Swift build files and finishes the [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]blocked-field contract.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]4[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]3[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202610/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]bob_refs_land_fixes.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202610/bob_refs_land_fixes.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim] Parent: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202610/bob_refs_panel.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]bob-cli-5s.10[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/bobs-org/bob-cli--beads/blob/main/pages/bob-cli-5s/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]bob-cli-5s.10.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]bob-cli blocked-field polish and stray .build cleanup[/bold #D7AFFF]         [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]cli-blocked-polish[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]cli-blocked-polish: untrack the stray `.build/` files and ignore [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]`/.build/`, serialize `blocked` directly after `reading_state_source`, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]add a several-trackers-with-one-[?] fixture test, and finish the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]docs/ref.md contract (client note, additive under schema_version 1).[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]RefsCore ranking, captions, dates, and refs-rank fixes[/bold #D7AFFF]        [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]refs-core-fixes[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]refs-core-fixes: in bob-mac-capture RefsCore, keep vanished ids in [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]refreshingContent as unavailable, let 2-character word prefixes reach [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]T1, compute days in signals.calendar instead of UTC, sort Ready by added[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]desc, mark git dates approximate, fix the weekday range, wire [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]frecencyHalfLifeDays, cache prepared items per snapshot, and make [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]refs-rank --now accept the documented form; with tests.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Search binding, open-error re-show, unavailable rows, refresh [bold black on #FFD75F][/bold #D7AFFF] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]triggers, and live settings[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]refs-model-fixes[dim] · [dim][/dim]after refs-core-fixes[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]refs-model-fixes: in bob-mac-capture, send typed text to the model, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]re-show the panel after an open error without resetting it and through [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]BobPanelCoordinator, render unavailable rows per spec §5.5, refresh on [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]wake, Today on every open, git dates in their own lane, ⌘R and Recheck [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]Bob refreshes that re-rank, and live settings re-registration that reads[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the new value; with tests.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Panel visuals, inspector honesty, ⌘K anchor, cleanup, README, [bold black on #FFD75F][/bold #D7AFFF] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]and final CI[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]refs-ui-fixes[dim] · [dim][/dim]after refs-model-fixes, cli-blocked-polish[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]refs-ui-fixes: in bob-mac-capture, add the content well, Reduce [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]Transparency base, and per-show scale-in; fix inspector honesty rules, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the 3 s intrinsics timeout, and the ⌘K anchor; render stem/secondary [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]caption ranges; fix row VoiceOver labels; remove dead symbols and debug [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]renders; make the README's Bob Refs section coherent; confirm final CI [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and render fixtures.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"bob-cli-5s.10","llm_provider":"muse","model":"muse-spark-1.3-contributor","patch_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","phase_bead_id":"bob-cli-5s.10.3","plan":true,"reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitHub","wait_for_beads":["bob-cli-5s.10.2"]},"source_run_id":"run-3d2f7ff5da265cf4101c5b968efe1c38","started_at":"2026-10-09T12:58:24.621421+00:00","state":"completed"},{"capabilities":{"durably_revivable":true,"historically_viewable":true,"missing_requirements":["prompt"],"restartable":false},"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"chat":{"digest":"6bd361f298e2d907bf62ac7a7d55b6291955003cfed1d6311a1c64eb2e475cf6","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-5s.10.land--code/chat.md","size_bytes":670},"commits":{"digest":"ff98ed2d64f31d3d61e6fc29c89825d707244118ab6e9bcc5dde673af25de72e","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-5s.10.land--code/commits.json","size_bytes":89},"embedded_workflows":{"digest":"3942241a63c5de53df93bede886ed35a51f8b6a33d5883d819c898d7dd34f408","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-5s.10.land--code/embedded_workflows.json","size_bytes":83},"meta":{"digest":"7f9bcf969dc6f273ce267d8a524aea66fe43dfb152329dcc711c8ae237ebd768","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-5s.10.land--code/meta.json","size_bytes":701},"prompt_steps":{"digest":"6b808d93dd070eb4ebcc791b61ed7660a8d901f9477b5c77b856b4bda9128957","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena